[3533]="70058AFB\n1\tDefeat the Beasts of Slaughter\tGorgar's trap has been sprung, and you must now fight in his arena or perish. You should defeat Gorgar's Beasts of Slaughter.\n2\tDefeat Gorgar and Ránulur\tYou have defeated the beasts, but Gorgar now intends to fight you himself! You must now face Gorgar the Ruthless and Ránulur, Chieftain of Wargs in the arena!\n3\tCompleted: Conquering the Bloody Threshold (Tier 5)\tYou have completed the Amdân Dammul, the Bloody Threshold on Tier 5.\n",
[3534]="70043E05\n1\tKill enemy guards on the Ornendil Bridge (total: 10)\tOrnendil Bridge is located in Northern Osgiliath over the Anduin River. You should kill enemy guards on the Ornendil Bridge.\n2\tListen to Shíktarb yell at you\tShíktarb is at Shrak Mauruk. You should listen to Shíktarb yell at you.\n",
[3535]="70056968\n1\tDefeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms\tThe Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\n2\tDefeat Thossulun the Massive\tThossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all gredbyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harassing your allies.\n3\tDefeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald\tRûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!\n4\tDefeat Shelob\tThe last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Shelob herself!\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 1)\tYou have completed the Remmorchant on Tier 1.\n",
[3536]="70056966\n1\tDefeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms\tThe Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\n2\tDefeat Thossulun the Massive\tThossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all Grebyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harrassing your allies.\n3\tDefeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald\tRûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!\n4\tDefeat Shelob\tThe last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Shelob herself!\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 2)\tYou have completed the Remmorchant on Tier 2.\n",
