[3539]="700579A4\n1\tDefeat Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms\tThe Ungoladan chieftain, Bratha Tasakh, Lady of Many Venoms, bars your path deeper into the Remmorchant.\n2\tDefeat Thossulun the Massive\tThossulun the Massive, daughter of Shelob and Queen of all Grebyg, must be defeated to stem the tide of insects harrassing your allies.\n3\tDefeat Rûkhor the Pale Herald\tRûkhor the Pale Herald has unveiled his nefarious scheme to you. You must defeat him and his Bloodless captain, Zabothak, to prevent Shelob from being unleashed!\n4\tDefeat Shelob\tThe last challenge is finally upon you: defeat Shelob herself!\n5\tCompleted: Conquering the Remmorchant (Tier 5)\tYou have completed the Remmorchant on Tier 5.\n",
[3540]="7005A67F\n1\tAssist in Conquering the Three Peaks\tZóva, Zádokh Flint-eye, Agátur the Boastful, and Bráthi can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset or the Hall of Vérnozal. You should talk to these dwarves as soon as you are able.\n2\tTalk to Zóva\030Talk to Agátur the Boastful\030Talk to Bráthi\030Talk to Zádokh Flint-eye\tZóva, Zádokh Flint-eye, Agátur the Boastful, and Bráthi can be found at Zidir-nesad, The Steepset or the Hall of Vérnozal. You should talk to these dwarves as soon as you are able.\n",
[3541]="7001927A\n1\tDefeat Orc-smiths (total: 4)\030Destroy weapon-stores (total: 5)\tFanuidhol lies to the north-west of Talan Fanuidhol. Bahanneth wants you to go into Fanuidhol and defeat some of the smiths there, as well as to destroy the stores of weapons they have forged.\n2\tTalk to Bahanneth at Talan Fanuidhol\tBahanneth is at Talan Fanuidhol, south-east of Fanuidhol. You should return to Bahanneth with tidings of your success.\n",
[3542]="7002BFA8\n1\tTalk to Aculf to join the assault on Atburg\tAculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg. Aculf has asked you to join him and his companions as they assault Atburg.\n2\tTalk to Aculf at his camp in the Rushgore\tAculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg. You should speak with Aculf regarding your victory at Atburg.\n",
[3543]="7002C133\n1\tTalk to Aculf to join the assault on Atburg\tAculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg. Aculf has asked you to join him and his companions as they assault Atburg.\n2\tTalk to Aculf at his camp in the Rushgore\tAculf is at his camp in the Rushgore, north-west of Atburg. You should speak with Aculf regarding your victory at Atburg.\n",
[3544]="7002BFA9\n1\tDefeat Ulferth\tUlferth, the captain of the treasure-hunters, must be defeated.\n",
[3545]="7004185C\n1\tDefeat Haradrim in Thama Aklam (total: 10)\030Defeat Half-trolls in Thama Aklam (total: 4)\030Search Haradrim sorcerers for orders from the Scourge (total: 3)\tThama Aklam can be found to the south-east of Ost Anglebed. Steward Malthellim has asked you to defeat the Haradrim camped nearby before they grow beyond control.\n2\tTalk to Steward Malthellim\tSteward Malthellim can be found in the Lord's Hall in Ost Anglebed. You have defeated many Haradrim in Thama Aklam, but were unable to find any orders. You should return to Steward Malthellim.\n",
[3546]="70022B45\n1\tDefeat Consuming Barrow-crawlers (total: 5)\tConsuming Barrow-crawlers can be found within the Flooded Wing of the Great Barrow.\n",
[3547]="70071621\n1\tComplete 'Instance: Consuming Madness'\tRazâl wishes to infiltrate the servant's quarters of the palace to help the civilians trapped there. You should talk to Razâl and complete 'Instance: Consuming Madness'.\n2\tTalk to Razâl\tYou have helped who you could flee the palace. You should talk to Razâl.\n",
[3548]="7004AC04\n1\tReach Level 115\030Travel to the Udûn Foothold\030Travel to the Ruins of Díngarth\030Travel to Magh Ashtu\030Travel to an Allegiance Hall\tExpedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls. They are Vórthi, Glórellas, Tancram, and Aster Hayward. You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.\n2\tTalk to your Expedition Organizer\tExpedition Organizers can be found in Allegiance Halls. They are Vórthi, Glórellas, Tancram, and Aster Hayward. You should talk to your Expedition Organizer.\n",
[3549]="7004859A\n1\tDefeat foes in the Noman-lands (total: 15)\tMany threats still lurk in the Noman-lands. You should defeat foes in the Noman-lands.\n2\tCompleted\tComplete\n",
[3550]="7002C9A2\n1\tCollect goat meat to bolster the rations (total: 12)\030Help Sabert deal with the threat of worms\030Help Sabert prevent worms from spreading their number\030Help Tatwine with a farming task\tGoats can be found roaming wild throughout Eorlsmead. You should hunt goats for meat to help stock the ration supply for Stangard.\n2\tBring the goat meat to Gadda\tGadda awaits you outside of the Mead Hall in Stangard. You should bring the meat you gathered to Gadda.\n",
[3551]="70067C3A\n1\tCollect intact crab claws ([see journal]/8)\030Collect crab shells ([see journal]/8)\030Collect delectable crab meat ([see journal]/8)\tPhâredar continues to collect the crab parts needed to make the recipes made famous by Keteph. You will need to return to the shoreline to west and south of Jax Phanâl. Collect the meat, shells, and claws from the crabs there and return them to Phâredar.\n2\tDeliver the crab meat, claws, and shells to Phâredar\tPhâredar continues to collect the crab parts needed to make the recipes made famous by Keteph. You will need to return to the shoreline to west and south of Jax Phanâl. Collect the meat, shells, and claws from the crabs there and return them to Phâredar.\n",
[3552]="7001757D\n1\tDefeat Globsnaga Orcs in the Foundations of Stone (total: 12)\tGlobsnaga Orcs infest the Foundations of Stone. Valthor has asked you to defeat Globsnaga Orcs to prove your might.\n2\tTalk to Valthor at the Shadowed Refuge\tValthor is at the Shadowed Refuge in the northern region of the Foundations of Stone. You should return to Valthor and tell him of your deeds.\n",
})
